    "A brief description of what this action does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "简要说明此操作的用途。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A download is in progress. Cancel it to make other changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在下载中。如需进行其他更改，请先取消下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A failed AI request never blocks local dictation; KVoice inserts the raw transcript instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 请求失败不会阻碍本地听写；KVoice 会改为插入原始转写文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A lone modifier key such as Right Option needs Accessibility permission to be detected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像右 Option 这样的单个修饰键，需要辅助功能权限才能被检测到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new message in your mail app, with diagnostics attached only if you tick the box. You can read and edit everything before sending.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在邮件应用中新建一封邮件，仅当勾选时才附带诊断信息。发送前可以查看并编辑全部内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Action Shortcuts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 操作快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Actions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Actions is off. The default action (%@ %@) is remembered for when it is turned on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "AI Actions is off. The default action (%1$@ %2$@) is remembered for when it is turned on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 操作已关闭。默认操作（%@ %@）会被记住，待开启后使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Actions is off; the default action is remembered for when it is turned on in the AI Actions section.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 操作已关闭；默认操作会被记住，待在“AI 操作”中开启后使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Actions need an endpoint and a model, or Apple Intelligence on this Mac. Nothing runs until one is configured and set as active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 操作需要一个端点和模型，或者这台 Mac 上的 Apple 智能。在配置并设为活跃之前，什么都不会运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Configuration": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI Configurations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
