    "Allow Microphone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许麦克风"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also copies the inserted text to the clipboard. Off, a successful insertion never touches the clipboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时把插入的文本复制到剪贴板。关闭时，成功的插入不会触碰剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also produce the translation in a second target language.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时生成第二种目标语言的译文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An extra way to cancel a dictation in progress. Escape always cancels.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消进行中听写的另一种方式。Escape 始终可以取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any length": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意长度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any model the provider serves; the picker above only suggests.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务商提供的任何模型；上方的选择器仅作建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance and Startup": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观与启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appends each completed dictation to a Markdown file named for the day (YYYY-MM-DD.md) in the folder you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把每次完成的听写追加到你选择的文件夹中以日期命名的 Markdown 文件（YYYY-MM-DD.md）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appends one space to the inserted text so the next dictation continues the sentence. History keeps the text without it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在插入的文本后追加一个空格，以便下一次听写接续句子。历史记录保存不带空格的文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appends the same redacted report as Copy Diagnostics: versions, permission and model status, and settings flags. Never a transcript, key, or endpoint path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附带与“复制诊断信息”相同的脱敏报告：版本、权限与模型状态、设置标志。绝不包含转写文本、密钥或端点路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence (Private Cloud Compute)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 智能（私密云计算）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence (on-device)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 智能（本机）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence isn't available on this Mac right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上的 Apple 智能目前不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence · runs on Private Cloud Compute (sends the transcript to Apple)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 智能 · 在私密云计算上运行（会将转写文本发送给 Apple）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence · runs on this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 智能 · 在这台 Mac 上运行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Speech takes the dictionary as recognition hints rather than a prompt: up to %lld short terms, ideally one or two words each. Whether a term is recognized is up to the model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 语音将词典作为识别提示而非提示词使用：最多 %lld 个简短词条，最好每条一到两个词。词条能否被识别取决于模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's options for a higher Private Cloud Compute limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 提供的提高私密云计算使用上限的选项。"
          }
        }
