      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "详细信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已检测到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Devices are remembered by hardware identity; a disconnected device falls back to the system default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备按硬件标识记忆；未连接的设备会回退到系统默认设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics record scalars only: state names, error codes, timings, and byte counts. Transcript text, audio, and API keys are never written to a log, and Copy Diagnostics below is redacted the same way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "诊断信息只记录标量：状态名、错误代码、耗时和字节数。转写文本、音频和 API 密钥绝不会写入日志，下方的“复制诊断信息”也按同样方式脱敏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictate into whatever field has focus — KVoice types straight into apps like Terminal, not just text boxes that accept pasted text. If a target cannot be reached safely, the finished text goes to the clipboard instead and the HUD says so.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 会向当前获得焦点的输入框听写——它可以直接输入到 Terminal 等应用中，而不仅限于接受粘贴的文本框。如果无法安全送达目标，完成的文本会改放到剪贴板，HUD 会说明这一点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictation can continue without saving new items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写可以继续，但不会保存新项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictation test failed: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写测试失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictation test transcript": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写测试转写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictation uses the current model and is Ready only when the status above is Ready. Streaming shows live text; the inserted text comes from the full pass.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写使用当前模型，且只有在上方状态为“就绪”时才可用。流式模式会实时显示文字；插入的文本来自完整转写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictionary": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dictionary note": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
