    "Duration": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each configuration stores a provider, endpoint, model, and its own key — or uses an Apple model with none of those: on this Mac, or on Apple's Private Cloud Compute. The active one is used by every action; switch from here or the menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个配置都会保存提供商、端点、模型及其专属密钥——或者使用无需这些的 Apple 模型：在这台 Mac 上，或在 Apple 的私密云计算上。当前启用的配置会用于所有操作；可在此处或菜单栏中切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each configuration stores a provider, endpoint, model, and its own key. Pick one by name from the menu bar to switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个配置保存服务商、端点、模型和它自己的密钥。可在菜单栏按名称选择以切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each dictation's audio is saved as a 16 kHz WAV in the KVoice data folder, readable only by your account, and removed after %@. Recordings enable playback and Retranscribe in History. They are never included in diagnostics.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次听写的音频以 16 kHz WAV 保存在 KVoice 数据文件夹中，只有你的账户可读，并在 %@ 后删除。录音可用于在历史记录中回放和重新转写。它们绝不会包含在诊断信息中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑"
          }
        }
