    "Every built-in action goes back to its shipped title, instructions, and trigger words, and any that was missing is added. Your own actions and mode settings are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个内置操作都会恢复为出厂时的标题、指令和触发词，缺失的会被补回。你自己的操作和模式设置会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every built-in action goes back to its shipped title, instructions, and trigger words, and any that was missing is added. Your own actions, mode settings, and configurations are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个内置操作都会恢复为出厂时的标题、指令和触发词，缺失的会被补回。你自己的操作、模式设置和配置会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every connected device is listed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已列出所有已连接的设备"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every dictation KVoice saved, newest first, with the raw and final text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 保存的每次听写，最新的在前，包含原始文本和最终文本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every model runs on this Mac and is verified against the catalog bundled with this release before it is loaded. Only the current model is kept in memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有模型都在这台 Mac 上运行，加载前会对照此版本随附的目录进行验证。只有当前模型会保留在内存中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every term in the file is already in the dictionary.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件中的每个词条都已在词典中。"
          }
