    },
    "Everything KVoice stores lives in this folder: settings, history, diagnostics, and the managed model. Nothing is kept anywhere else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 存储的所有内容都在这个文件夹中：设置、历史记录、诊断信息和托管模型。别处不保存任何内容。"
          }
