    "History is unavailable. Dictation can continue without saving new items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "历史记录不可用。听写可以继续，但不会保存新项目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold for %lld ms before recording starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住 %lld 毫秒后开始录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold the middle mouse button past the activation delay to start; press it again to stop. Ordinary middle clicks pass through. Needs Accessibility permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住鼠标中键超过激活延迟即开始；再按一次停止。普通的中键点按会正常传递。需要辅助功能权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold your shortcut, speak, and let go. KVoice records while you dictate, transcribes the speech on this Mac, and places the finished text at your cursor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住快捷键，说话，然后松开。KVoice 在你听写时录音，在这台 Mac 上转写语音，并把完成的文本放到光标处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How KVoice appears on this Mac, the setup guide, and the reset tools.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 在这台 Mac 上的显示方式、设置向导和重置工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the finished text reaches the app. Accessibility insertion is always tried first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成的文本如何进入应用。始终优先尝试通过辅助功能插入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hybrid (tap to toggle, hold to talk)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "混合（轻按切换，按住说话）"
