            "value": "界面语言"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Item deleted. Undo available for ten seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目已删除。十秒内可以撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its instructions are removed and cannot be restored. Built-in actions, your other actions, and the AI endpoint are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的指令将被移除且无法恢复。内置操作、你的其他操作和 AI 端点会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its instructions are removed and cannot be restored. Built-in actions, your other actions, and your AI configurations are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的指令将被移除且无法恢复。内置操作、你的其他操作和你的 AI 配置会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its saved API key is removed with it. The endpoint fields below, your other configurations, and your actions are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存的 API 密钥会随之移除。下方的端点字段、你的其他配置和操作会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its saved API key is removed with it. Your other configurations and your actions are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存的 API 密钥会随之移除。你的其他配置和操作会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice always lives in the menu bar; macOS may ask you to approve the login item once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 始终位于菜单栏；macOS 可能会要求你批准一次登录项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice could not register itself as a login item. You can add it in System Settings › General › Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 无法将自己注册为登录项。你可以在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项”中添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice could not remove its login item. You can remove it in System Settings › General › Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 无法移除它的登录项。你可以在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项”中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice follows the system default input in this build. Change it in System Settings › Sound › Input.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本的 KVoice 跟随系统默认输入设备。可在“系统设置 › 声音 › 输入”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 需要处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice needs to hear you, and only while you are dictating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 需要听到你的声音，且仅在你听写时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice quit before the text was inserted": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本插入前 KVoice 已退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice quits and opens again. Nothing is deleted; a dictation in progress is cancelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 会退出并重新打开。不删除任何内容；进行中的听写会被取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice stops using the folder but does not delete it. Dictation is Not Ready until a model is downloaded or chosen again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 会停止使用该文件夹但不删除它。在重新下载或选择模型之前，听写处于“未就绪”状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice tones": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 音效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KVoice tones are four short notes played at media volume. Classic uses the Tink, Pop, Funk and Purr alert sounds; a named sound is used for every cue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 音效是以媒体音量播放的四个短音。经典使用 Tink、Pop、Funk 和 Purr 提醒音；选择某个具名提示音则所有提示都使用它。"
          }
        }
      }
