    "Names and jargon the model should spell your way. Sent as a hint with every dictation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "希望模型按你的写法拼写的名称和术语。随每次听写作为提示发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Names and jargon the model tends to misspell. They are sent to the speech model as a hint with every dictation, streaming pass, and transcribed file — it nudges the spelling, it cannot guarantee it. One list for every language.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型容易拼错的名称和术语。它们会随每次听写、每轮流式转写和每个转写文件作为提示发送给语音模型 — 只能引导拼写，不能保证。所有语言共用一个列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
