      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. When off, no audio is written; recordings already saved stay until their retention passes or you clear history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。关闭时不写入任何音频；已保存的录音会保留到保留期结束或你清除历史记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. When on, the text is sent to your AI endpoint as reference material for this action only. KVoice never captures the screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。开启时，该文本仅作为此操作的参考资料发送到你的 AI 端点。KVoice 绝不捕获屏幕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: transcripts are kept until you delete them. The picker sets what Run Cleanup Now removes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭：转写会保留到你删除为止。选择器决定“立即运行清理”移除哪些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older transcripts and their recordings are removed, and recordings older than %@ are removed from newer transcripts. Newer transcripts, your settings, and the local model are kept. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更早的转写及其录音会被移除，较新转写中早于 %@ 的录音也会被移除。较新的转写、你的设置和本地模型会保留。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Apple's servers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Apple 的服务器上"
          }
        }
