            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分配"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Placement is Core ML's plan for where each operation runs, not a measurement. Apple Neural Engine load has no public counter; use Placement and the performance test.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“分配”是 Core ML 对每个操作运行位置的规划，不是实际测量。Apple 神经网络引擎的负载没有公开计数器；请参考“分配”和性能测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Placement: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分配：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plain text, one term per line. Import adds to the list — duplicates are skipped and anything past the budget is left out and reported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
