          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行于 %@（RTF %@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs Apple's on-device language model through the Foundation Models framework (macOS 26 or later). No endpoint, no key, and nothing leaves this Mac. Expect cleanup-grade results — below cloud models — and a context window of about 4,000 tokens; a longer transcript is inserted unpolished.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 Foundation Models 框架运行 Apple 的本机语言模型（需要 macOS 26 或更高版本）。无需端点和密钥，数据不会离开这台 Mac。效果为清理级别（低于云端模型），上下文窗口约 4,000 个 token；更长的转写文本将原样插入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs when KVoice launches and once a day. Transcripts older than %@ are removed with their recordings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 KVoice 启动时以及每天运行一次。早于 %@ 的转写及其录音会被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
