    "Select text in any app, press a slot's shortcut, and KVoice runs that action on the selection and inserts the result in its place through Accessibility — never a simulated paste. Experimental.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任意应用中选中文本，按下某个槽位的快捷键，KVoice 会对所选文本运行该操作，并通过辅助功能把结果插入原位 — 绝不模拟粘贴。实验性功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
