        }
      }
    },
    "Sends the clipboard's text with each request for this action, in a separate tagged block.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随此操作的每个请求发送剪贴板文本，放在单独的标记块中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends the focused field's selection with each request for this action, in a separate tagged block.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随此操作的每个请求发送当前输入框中选中的文本，放在单独的标记块中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends the transcript, the action's instructions and any context you turned on to Apple's Private Cloud Compute over the internet. Apple states that requests are used only to answer them, are not stored, and are not accessible to Apple. Dictation sends nothing here unless this configuration is active and AI Actions is on (Verify & Save and Test send one short test request), and KVoice never switches to it on its own. Requires macOS 27, the Mac App Store edition of KVoice and Apple Intelligence; each person has a daily request limit tied to their Apple Account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会通过互联网将转写文本、该操作的指令以及你开启的任何上下文发送到 Apple 的私密云计算。Apple 表示，请求仅用于生成回复，不会被存储，Apple 也无法访问。除非此配置处于启用状态且 AI 操作已开启，听写不会向这里发送任何内容（“验证并保存”和“测试”会发送一次简短的测试请求）；KVoice 也绝不会自行切换到它。需要 macOS 27、Mac App Store 版 KVoice 以及 Apple 智能；每个人都有与其 Apple 账户关联的每日请求上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
