          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在验证 — %lld / %lld 个文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verifying…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在验证…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice Activity Detection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音活动检测"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for macOS": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待 macOS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for you to enable KVoice in System Settings. This screen updates by itself once it is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待你在“系统设置”中启用 KVoice。开启后此屏幕会自动更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting on %@. Use Fix… above to set it up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待%@。请用上方的“修复…”进行设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm-up": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预热"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waveform": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "波形"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What KVoice does with your voice, and what never leaves this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 如何处理你的语音，以及哪些内容绝不会离开这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What KVoice keeps on this Mac, for how long, and where it is exported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 在这台 Mac 上保留哪些内容、保留多久，以及导出到哪里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What KVoice needs from macOS, and whether it has it right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KVoice 需要 macOS 的哪些权限，以及现在是否已获得。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happens while you record and how the finished text is inserted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音时会发生什么，以及完成的文本如何插入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you hear while dictating. Mute restores the volume on every exit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写时你会听到的内容。静音会在每次退出时恢复音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a transcript begins with one of these, this action runs instead of the default and the trigger phrase is removed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当转写文本以其中一个开头时，运行此操作而非默认操作，并移除触发短语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an app's text field cannot be written through Accessibility, KVoice types the text as keystrokes instead of copying it to the clipboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当应用的文本框无法通过辅助功能写入时，KVoice 会以按键方式键入文本，而不是复制到剪贴板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, KVoice appears in the Dock as well as the menu bar. The menu-bar item is always shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，KVoice 会同时显示在程序坞和菜单栏中。菜单栏项目始终显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, KVoice unloads the speech model on its own if the Mac reaches critical memory pressure and no dictation is running. The next dictation reloads it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，如果 Mac 出现严重内存压力且当前没有听写在进行，KVoice 会自行卸载语音模型。下一次听写会重新加载它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, a transcript that begins with an action's trigger word runs that action instead of the default. The trigger phrase is removed from the text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "启用后，以某个操作的触发词开头的转写会运行该操作而非默认操作。触发短语会从文本中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, new dictations are not saved. Existing entries stay until you clear them in History.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时不会保存新的听写。现有条目会保留到你在“历史记录”中清除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the default action runs after each transcription.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启时，默认操作会在每次转写后运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the text goes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本去向"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the text goes, the menu bar, and how to customize KVoice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本去向、菜单栏，以及如何自定义 KVoice。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether dictations are saved at all. History is stored only on this Mac. Turning it off stops new entries; it does not delete the ones already saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是否保存听写。历史记录只存储在这台 Mac 上。关闭会停止新增条目；不会删除已保存的条目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which microphone KVoice listens to while you dictate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你听写时 KVoice 使用哪个麦克风。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While Recording": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whisper models take a short prompt before the audio; other models may take none.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whisper 模型会在音频之前接受一段简短的提示；其他模型可能不接受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes the finished text at the cursor of the app you are dictating into. KVoice does not read documents or watch keystrokes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把完成的文本写入你正在听写的应用的光标处。KVoice 不读取文稿，也不监视按键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written path: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入路径：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your instructions are combined with a general-purpose template that keeps the transcript as data, forbids commentary, and names the input tags.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的指令会与通用模板结合，该模板把转写文本当作数据、禁止评论并指定输入标签。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your instructions are sent verbatim as the whole system prompt. Full control, for advanced users.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的指令会原样作为完整的系统提示词发送。完全控制，适合高级用户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your settings, history, and models are kept. Export first if you want a copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的设置、历史记录和模型会保留。如需副本请先导出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
